# Life node, November to February, fallback only: 2 hours from 08:00 local clock time, about sunrise in midwinter.
# life-schedule writes the schedule computed for the node's place (2 hours from sunrise) instead, and uses this file
# only if that computation fails
BEGIN	2026-11-01 08:00:00
END	2035-12-31 23:59:59
ON	H2
OFF	H22
